        "attribution": "Katori originated the magic-wavelength lattice-clock concept, and Ye made seminal experimental advances and broad applications possible.",
        "maturity": "Exceptional performance has been replicated and the technology has generated sustained scientific uses.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The ultimate scope of fundamental discoveries enabled by the clocks is still developing."
        ]
      }
    },
