        "nobel_worthiness": "Inflation and the quantum account of primordial structure profoundly reshaped cosmology and supplied a compelling account of observed large-scale regularities.",
        "attribution": "Guth initiated inflation, Linde developed its viable forms, and Mukhanov supplied the crucial quantitative account of primordial perturbations.",
        "maturity": "Its main phenomenological consequences agree strikingly with CMB and structure observations over many years.",
        "uncertainties": [
